The images in this folder are a small selection of sign crops from the dataset

  Homburg, T., Mara, H. (2023). MaiCuBeDa Hilprecht - Mainz Cuneiform Benchmark Dataset.
  Heidelberg University. https://doi.org/10.11588/DATA/QSNIQ2

which is released under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The images are the dataset's sign-level annotation crops (MSII rendering), selected per class
for the demo gallery; they were not otherwise altered. You may share and adapt them under the
terms of CC BY-SA 4.0: give appropriate credit (the citation above), indicate changes, and
distribute derivatives under the same licence.

The licence of this folder applies to these images only. The source code of the repository is
licensed separately under the MIT licence (see ../LICENSE).
